repository-code: "https://github.com/mattek8/chatgpt-onedrive-personal-workaround"
url: "https://github.com/mattek8/chatgpt-onedrive-personal-workaround"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A validated seed-based compatibility workaround for using OneDrive Personal
  (Microsoft Account / MSA) as a writable document store when ChatGPT's
  Microsoft SharePoint/OneDrive connector exposes exact Graph-backed item
  operations but lacks or cannot use convenient native create/search/delete
  actions on the tested personal account.
keywords:
  - ChatGPT
  - OneDrive Personal
  - Microsoft Graph
  - Microsoft Account
  - MSA
  - SharePoint connector
  - document store
  - workaround
